      :motivation "Whole-ledger consistency requires graph and provenance checks, not a task-count banner or deletion of an aggregate filename. Measured 2026-09-11: 407 distinct :owns paths across all task collections, 62 absent on disk; 32 are declared outputs of D81 tasks not yet executed (correct) and 30 are relics of completed phases, of which 18 are deleted tests/test_*_e2e.sh gate scripts and 12 are phantom sources (agent/src/swarm.asl, vdom/src/diff.asl, voice/src/audio_capture.asl, voice/src/voice_intel.asl, web-api-search/src/dialectical.asl, intel/tests/health_test.asl, asl-gates manifest-gate pair, two GAPS.asn, scratch/eddie_harbor.py, ~/.addie/config.json). A missing :owns path is a defect only when its phase is complete; distinguish the two."
      :purpose "Check every task collection for unique identities, defined dependencies, acyclicity, ownership/projection sources, actual gate readiness and receipt-bound completion; generated aggregate indexes must agree with canonical ADRs/tasks without deleting useful index surfaces."
      :context (:contractRef D81PlanContext)
      :outcomes ["Validate the complete task graph and truthful completion states"]
      :owns ["asl/tools/asl.c" ".asl/mem/tasks" ".asl/mem/decisions" ".asl/mem/roadmap.asn" "mem/grammar.asn" ".asl/mem/reviews/D81PlanSettlement.asn" ".asl/mem/intent.asn" ".asl/mem/decisions.asn" ".asl/mem/decisions/decisions.asn"]
